# House Hlaalu: the Twin Lamps, Ilmeni Dren's last task.
# "Free Hides-His-Foot" (HH_TwinLamps3): Ilmeni, "slavery" (10); at the Dren Plantation Hides-His-Foot greets an
# envoy of Ilmeni and, "travel together", follows the player (50: AiFollow Player 0 34770 -38050 680, Sterdecan's
# Farm); his own script (hidesFootScript) logs 70 when that follow is done or the player is in Sterdecan's
# Farmhouse; Ilmeni, "slavery" (100). Hides-His-Foot really walks: ONE walk to his destination.
# Position + `approach` stand in for the travel (no follower along yet).
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance --instance 2 mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_a1_11_report --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case hh_twin_lamps3_start
run
player->PositionCell 417 -412 -103 0 "Vivec, St. Delyn Canal South-One"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, St. Delyn Canal South-One" == 1
approach 052DA0B7
talk ilmeni dren
ask slavery
expect GetJournalIndex HH_TwinLamps3 == 10
bye
end

case hh_twin_lamps3_escort
defend
run
player->Position 18000 -56650 640 0
until 300 player->GetDistance hides_his_foot < 2000
approach 055F1FFD
talk hides_his_foot
ask travel together
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex HH_TwinLamps3 == 50
bye
walk 34770 -38050 680
until 3000 GetJournalIndex HH_TwinLamps3 >= 70
run
player->PositionCell 417 -412 -103 0 "Vivec, St. Delyn Canal South-One"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, St. Delyn Canal South-One" == 1
approach 052DA0B7
talk ilmeni dren
ask slavery
expect GetJournalIndex HH_TwinLamps3 == 100
bye
end
